<title>HONG KONG: Mandarin Res 1995/96 net rises 62.03 pct.</title>
<headline>Mandarin Res 1995/96 net rises 62.03 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
